{
  "title": "People, pronouns and 是",
  "note": "是 (shì) links two nouns: 我是学生 \"I am a student.\" Negate it with 不: 我不是老师. Mandarin pronouns never change form: 我 is both \"I\" and \"me\". Add 们 for plurals of pronouns, and 的 for possession: 我的书 \"my book\".",
